User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=CONVECTIVE AVAILABLE POTENTIAL ENERGY (CAPE) [00748b19-30cc-4d12-a7a3-0aa8b3be5a94,309801] - Stability/Severe Weather Indices [7844ae66-f542-442f-8359-05014bc19831,309797]</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Convective Available Potential Energy = in units of Joules per kilogram (J/kg) is a measure of the cumulative buoyancy of a parcel as it rises.</skos:definition>
