    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="PhysicalGeography.net" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A long narrow channel of water that flows as a function of gravity and elevation across the Earth&apos;s surface. Many streams empty into lakes, seas or oceans.</skos:definition>
