    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CYCLONES</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-02 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: An atmospheric cyclonic circulation, a closed circulation.  A cyclone&apos;s direction of rotation (counterclockwise in the Northern Hemisphere) is opposite to that of an anticyclone.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
