    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="The Nature and Properties of Soils, Prentice Hall, 1996." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The property of a soil that is based upon three components of hue,chroma (intensity or brightness), and value (lightness or darkness).</skos:definition>
