    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Oceanography: Perspectives on a Fluid Earth, Steve Neshyba, John Wiley &amp; Sons, 1987." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In the oceans, a mixing process through which a component of seawater(e.g. salt) is transferred from a zone of higher concentration to a zoneof lesser concentration.</skos:definition>
