User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=DROUGHT/PRECIPITATION RECONSTRUCTION [06bcba40-6046-4c0e-aa38-8f83410b93f0,40155] - PALEOCLIMATE RECONSTRUCTIONS [6f6423e8-ab4e-4572-8982-d9c40f64e28b,40149]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="WDC for Paleoclimatology: http://www.ncdc.noaa.gov/paleo/recons.html" xml:lang="en"/>
