    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Describes the development, execution and supervision of plans, policies, programs and practices that control, protect, deliver and enhance the value of data. The data handling component refers to the process of ensuring that data is stored, archived, or disposed of in a safe and secure manner during and after the conclusion of a research project and/or data retrieval.</skos:definition>
