    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ZOOPLANKTON</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Krebs, Charles K. Ecology - 4th ed. 1994.  HarperCollins College Publishers, New York, New York." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Zooplankton is the animal portion of the plankton; the animal communityin marine and freshwater situations that floats free in the water,independent of the shore and the bottom, moving passively with thecurrents.</skos:definition>
