    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="cfaf76ef-89e2-4dc8-a4eb-b3308ef8c52c"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The erosion, transport, and deposition of material due to the action of the wind at or near the Earth&apos;s surface. Aeolian processes are at their most effective when the vegetation cover is discontinuous or absent.</skos:definition>
