    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from Webopedia: http://www.pcwebopedia.com/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Services that provide online capabilities for searching (typically through a user-friendly web-based search engine) to locate and retrieve (directdownloading or ordering) scientific data sets from databases orarchives.</skos:definition>
