    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CHEMICAL CONCENTRATIONS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-11 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The abundance of a constituent divided by the total volume of a mixture. Furthermore, in chemistry, four types of mathematical description can be distinguished: mass concentration, molar concentration, number concentration, and volume concentration.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-02-18 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=CHEMICAL CONCENTRATIONS [12ed4fa0-27cc-4e05-a2b7-bbf2fde871f6,82359] - GEOCHEMICAL PROPERTIES [048df94e-841d-4f4d-a5c5-6683d1d07aa6,82357]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Compendium of Chemical Terminology" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The abundance of a constituent divided by the total volume of a mixture. Furthermore, in chemistry, four types of mathematical description can be distinguished: mass concentration, molar concentration, number concentration, and volume concentration.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2013-03-11 13:33:06.0</dcterms:modified>
    <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://gcmd.earthdata.nasa.gov/kms/concepts/concept_scheme/sciencekeywords"/>
  </skos:Concept>
  <skos:Concept rdf:about="59920ad4-85fb-4cee-ba56-f39bc5857a3d">
    <skos:broader rdf:resource="02ea239e-4bca-4fda-ab87-be12c723c30a"/>
    <dcterms:created>2021-02-26</dcterms:created>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">AEROSOL CONCENTRATION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2021-03-02 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Volume of a colloidal system in which the dispersed phase is composed of either solid or liquid particles, and in which the dispersion medium is some gas, usually air.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2021-02-26 User Id=tstevens Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=AEROSOL CONCENTRATION [59920ad4-85fb-4cee-ba56-f39bc5857a3d,560862] - AEROSOL PARTICLE PROPERTIES [02ea239e-4bca-4fda-ab87-be12c723c30a,85549]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="https://glossary.ametsoc.org/wiki/Aerosol" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Volume of a colloidal system in which the dispersed phase is composed of either solid or liquid particles, and in which the dispersion medium is some gas, usually air.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2021-03-02 09:12:42.0</dcterms:modified>
