    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-07-31 User Id=saritz Entity=NarrowerRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add narrower relation
New Value=MINIMUM CENTRAL PRESSURE [38cefcb2-f5d6-4917-a87b-7cfba482e30d,217795] - TYPHOONS (WESTERN N. PACIFIC) [cfb85bf2-9920-4e3f-bce3-3d8f68ab1436,247563]</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-07-31 User Id=saritz Entity=NarrowerRelation Operation=INSERT 
