    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-05 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=NarrowerRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add narrower relation
New Value=SEDIMENT TRANSPORT [0b5e5a9b-5552-4e41-b1a1-9c01c52dff4b,105445] - LOESS [5ce16b97-c91c-420c-9701-33d19d50b286,105449]</skos:changeNote>
