    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-08-16 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A hill of sand built by aeolian processes. Dunes occur in different forms and sizes, formed by interaction with the wind. Most kinds of dunes are longer on the windward side where the sand is pushed up the dune and have a shorter &quot;slip face&quot; in the lee of the wind.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
