    <skos:changeNote>Date=2017-03-10 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Soil formed in either mineral or organic materials having permafrost either
within 1 m below the surface or, if the soil is strongly cryoturbated, with 2 m
below the surface, and having a mean annual ground temperature below 0 deg C.
