    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Glossary of Meteorology, American Meteorological Society, 2000." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A wave on a uniform current in a two-dimensional nondivergent fluid system,
rotating with varying angle speed about the local vertical (beta plane).</skos:definition>
