    <skos:changeNote>Date=2018-03-07 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Nutrients are elements essential for growth and survival of a given organism.
 Directly or indirectly, nutrients have roles in metabolism that no
other nutrients fulfills.
