    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-09 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The scientific study of the distribution of living organisms, biological records describe the presence, abundance, associations, and changes, both in time and space, of wildlife.
