    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The physical interaction of flowing water and the natural channels of rivers and streams. Such processes play an essential and conspicuous role in the denudation of land surfaces and the transport of rock detritus from higher to lower levels.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2024-10-04 14:17:38.0</dcterms:modified>
