    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Raimundo Real, A. Marcia Barbosa, Joseph W. Bull, Systematic Biology, Volume 66, Issue 3, May 2017, Pages 453–462, https://doi.org/10.1093/sysbio/syw072" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Species distributions are typically represented by records of their observed occurrence at a given spatial and temporal scale</skos:definition>
