System Note=add broader relation
New Value=CARBON FOOTPRINT [0e530a5f-1e75-4602-9659-98ff5c3d7076,368627] - ENVIRONMENTAL GOVERNANCE/MANAGEMENT [d81b77be-0177-4e26-942c-aa911239482d,87343]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from the ​IPCC WGIII AR5 Glossary" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Measure of the exclusive total amount of emissions of carbon dioxide(CO2) that is directly and indirectly caused by an activity or is accumulated over the life stages of a product. This term is often used in reference to greenhouse gas emissions attributable to persons,industries, or countries.</skos:definition>
