    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-03 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Any non-linear shaped opening enclosed by ice. May contain brash ice and/or
be covered with new ice, nilas or young ice; sub-mariners refer to these
as skylights. Polynyas are important in the study of the energy budget of
the polar ocean and local and regional climatology.
New Value=Any non-linear shaped opening enclosed by ice. May contain brash ice and/or
be covered with new ice, nilas or young ice; sub-mariners refer to these
as skylights. Polynyas are important in the study of the energy budget of
the polar ocean and local and regional climatology.</skos:changeNote>
