    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any non-linear shaped opening enclosed by ice. May contain brash ice and/orbe covered with new ice, nilas or young ice; sub-mariners refer to theseas skylights. Polynyas are important in the study of the energy budget ofthe polar ocean and local and regional climatology.</skos:definition>
