    <skos:changeNote>Date=2016-07-01 User Id=saritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=An extended interval of abnormally dry weather sufficiently prolonged for
the lack of water to cause a serious hydrological imbalance (i.e., crop
damage, water supply shortage, etc.) in the affected area.
New Value=A period of abnormally dry weather sufficiently long enough to cause a serious hydrological imbalance.</skos:changeNote>
