    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-25 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=A set of deposited sedimentary beds that reflects the depositional
environment of those beds and the geologic history of a region. 
A stratigraphic sequence is a chronologic succession of sedimentary rocks from
older below to younger above without interruption.
New Value=A set of deposited sedimentary beds that reflects the depositional
environment of those beds and the geologic history of a region. 
A stratigraphic sequence is a chronologic succession of sedimentary rocks from
older below to younger above without interruption.</skos:changeNote>
