    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from: Press, F. and Siever, R. 1986. Earth. W.H. Freeman and Company. Fourth Edition. p. 645." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A set of deposited sedimentary beds that reflects the depositionalenvironment of those beds and the geologic history of a region.</skos:definition>
