    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="&apos;http://elm.aero.und.edu/forestry/drought.html&apos;" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Satellite Soil Moisture Index combines AVHRR-measured NDVI with
surface temperature to compute an estimate of plant moisture stress,
then scales it to produce an index image.</skos:definition>
