    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="944d9d09-4317-4e9a-9aa5-dc4282be406e"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Habitat found in the zone on mountain tops between permanent snow and the cold limits of trees, or in arctic regions, characterized by very low winter temperatures, short cool summers, permafrost below a surface layer subject to summer melt, short growing season, and low precipitation.</skos:definition>
