New Value=QUASI-BIENNUAL OSCILLATION (QBO) ZONAL WIND INDEX [17e33fba-625b-40eb-b51d-902a89ca5747,278907] - WIND INDICES [25775905-dac3-4834-b709-f38a0a03b258,278861]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="NCAR UCAR Climate Data Guide" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The quasi-biennial oscillation (QBO) is a quasi-periodic oscillation of the equatorial zonal wind between easterlies and westerlies in the tropical stratosphere with a mean period of 28 to 29 months.</skos:definition>
