    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Sedimentary Geology: An Introduction to Sedimentary Rocks and Stratigraphy,  ISBN 0-7167-2726-9" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The composition of a sediment, which can be measured in terms of parent rock lithology, mineral composition, and chemical make-up.</skos:definition>
