    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Western Fertilizer Handbook, California Fertilizer Association, 1995." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any natural or manufactured material added to the soil in order to supplyone or more plant nutrients.  The term is generally applied to inorganicmaterials other than lime or gypsum sold in the trade.</skos:definition>
