text: A chemical element and a lustrous transition metal with a silver color, low density, and high strength. Titanium is resistant to corrosion in sea water, aqua regia, and chlorine. [
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Oxford University Press" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A chemical element and a lustrous transition metal with a silver color, low density, and high strength. Titanium is resistant to corrosion in sea water, aqua regia, and chlorine.</skos:definition>
