    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">LIVESTOCK PRODUCTS</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from: Herren, R.V., and R.L. Donahue.  1991.  The Agriculture Dictionary, Delmar Publishers INC.  Albany, New york.  553pp." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any measurement related to livestock commodities (does not include DAIRYor Poultry) including, but not limited to: meat, wool, leather, glue,chemicals (e.g. insulin), and any other edible or none edible productsfrom beef cattle, swine, sheep, horses, and goats.</skos:definition>
