    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Large-scale maps and nautical charts required to properly depict shoreline, shoreline features, navigation aids, and other navigationally significant features such as piers, docks, pilings, etc. These maps are compiled from remotely sensed data such as aerial photographs, LIDAR or satellite imagery.</skos:definition>
