    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">VOLATILE ORGANIC COMPOUNDS</skos:prefLabel>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Dictionary of Environmental Science and Technology, John Wiley &amp; Sons,1996." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Organic compounds (e.g. ethylene, propylene, benzene, styrene, acetone)which evaporate readily and contribute to air pollution directly orthrough chemical or photochemical reactions to produce secondary airpollutants.</skos:definition>
