text: The Niño1+2 SST anomaly index is an indicator of far eastern tropical Pacific El Niño conditions, off the coasts of Peru and Chile. It is calculated with SSTs in the box 90°W - 80°W, 10°S - 0°.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
