    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="The Nature and Properties of Soils, Prentice Hall, 1996." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The percentage of water remaining in a soil two or three days after itshaving been saturated and after free drainage has practically ceased(field moisture capacity).</skos:definition>
