    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">STRATOCUMULUS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-09 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Low-level clumps or patches of cloud varying in color from bright white to dark grey. They are the most common clouds on earth recognized by their well-defined bases, with some parts often darker than others. They usually have gaps between them, but they can also be joined together.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
