Old Value=MAGNETIC ANOMALIES [65ae8ab2-489b-44bf-bf5b-43cf957b70c0,63569] - GEOMAGNETISM [910013d7-1e6a-4d1a-9921-be32d792a290,61749]</skos:changeNote>
