    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Nebel, Bernard J. and Richard T. Wright.  Environmental Science.  1998. Prentice Hall." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The ability of some microorganisms to utilize the chemical energy containedin certain inorganic chemicals such as hydrogen sulfide for the productionof organic material.</skos:definition>
