    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Scambos, T., T. Haran, M. Fahnestock, T. Painter, and J. Bohlander. 2007. MODIS-based Mosaic of Antarctica (MOA) Data Sets: Continent-wide Surface Morphology and Snow Grain Size. Remote Sensing of Environment 111(2): 242-257, doi:10.1016/j.rse.2006.12.020." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The size of individual snow grains in micrometers.</skos:definition>
