    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-04 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Landforms created by the processes of wind erosion or deposition of wind
weathered surface materials. These include landforms with some of the following
geomorphic features: sand dunes, deflation hollows, and desert pavement.
Alternative spelling &quot;aeolian landforms.&quot;
New Value=Landforms created by the processes of wind erosion or deposition of wind
weathered surface materials. These include landforms with some of the following
geomorphic features: sand dunes, deflation hollows, and desert pavement.
Alternative spelling &quot;aeolian landforms.&quot;</skos:changeNote>
