    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="cae41424-161f-4378-a1a4-62cd76c61143"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Landforms created by the processes of wind erosion or deposition of windweathered surface materials. These include landforms with some of the followinggeomorphic features: sand dunes, deflation hollows, and desert pavement.Alternative spelling &apos;aeolian landforms.&apos;</skos:definition>
