System Note=update Definition
Old Value=The vaporization of water through direct evaporation from wet surfaces plus
the release of water vapor by plants through leaf pores.
New Value=The combined processes through which water is transferred to the atmosphere from open water and ice surfaces, bare soil, and vegetation that make up the earth&apos;s surface.</skos:changeNote>
