    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">With respect to pollution, the discharge of gases or particles from asource such as a smokestack or exhaust pipe into the atmosphere, perhapsresulting in environmental pollution. With respect to radiation, thegeneration and sending out of radiant energy.</skos:definition>
