    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Adapted from: Herren, R.V., and R.L. Donahue.  1991.  The Agriculture Dictionary, Delmar Publishers INC.  Albany, New york.  553pp." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Any measure related to gene mapping, animal species breeding for hybridor higher value species, breeding for increased production, diseaseresistance, pest resistance, or related genetic measures.</skos:definition>
