    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FIRE DYNAMICS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Describes the physical state of the fire and/or its effect. This may include
the time and location, duration, aerial extent, temperature, radiative power,
and emission products of the fire event.</skos:definition>
