    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Phylum Chordata. Class Actinopterygii. Order Cyprinodontiformes. Pupfish are ray-finned fish similar to minnows but distinguished by small mouths with teeth and typically found in extreme aquatic habitats.</skos:definition>
