New Value=HIGHER MAXIMUM DAYTIME TEMPERATURES [3d997f01-8987-4fb1-a32e-d88d51f0a2c4,39779] - TEMPERATURE INDICATORS [2dcffd8f-2b01-4c68-a4f2-c4940d2709a3,39777]</skos:changeNote>
