    <skos:narrower rdf:resource="7acd7fd4-a9ed-4af9-a0e6-1f6bccb17a3c"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The degree to which Aerosols prevent light from passing through. Opticaldepth/thickness depends upon the physical constitution ,the form, and theconcentration of particles.</skos:definition>
