    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">PARTICULATE MATTER (PM 1.0)</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2023-02-16 User Id=tstevens Entity=PrefLabel Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update PrefLabel
Old Value=PARTICULATE MATTER _PM 1.0_
New Value=PARTICULATE MATTER (PM 1.0)</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2024-10-23 User Id=tstevens Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A type of air pollution that is made up of particles that are less than 1 micron in size. PM1 is particularly dangerous because of its small size, which allows it to penetrate lung tissue and enter the bloodstream.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
