    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="GCMD Science Staff and the NASA Goddard Institute for Space Studies Atmospheric Chemistry research home page.  http://www.giss.nasa.gov/research/chemistry/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">(A numerical representation of) the chemical constituents of Earth&apos;s
atmosphere, and the roles they play in influencing the atmosphere&apos;s
temperature, radiation, and dynamics.</skos:definition>
