System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: 
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="https://essopenarchive.org/users/798053/articles/1148596-global-multi-scale-eulerian-and-lagrangian-oceanic-environmental-variables-for-the-period-2000-2009" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponent (FTLE) is a well-established numerical tool for assessing stretching rates of initial parcels of fluid. FTLE is referenced as part of the Global multi-scale Eulerian and Lagrangian oceanic 2 environmental variables for the period 2000-2009.</skos:definition>
