User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=SPATIAL SUBSETTING [3c6d5e60-c312-4589-9918-b0f44b2ae8cd,560229] - SUBSETTING/SUPERSETTING [cc9e67fc-eafa-43cc-879f-0cb56b25bc39,84341]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="https://geocompr.robinlovelace.net/spatial-operations.html" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The process of selecting features of a spatial object based on whether or not they in some way relate in space to another object.</skos:definition>
