    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-02 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Reforestation is the replanting of trees in forests where the trees have
been cut down.  Reforestation sometimes is undertaken in an effort to
reduce atmospheric carbon dioxide levels by restoring forests, which are
carbon sinks.
New Value=Reforestation is the replanting of trees in forests where the trees have been cut down.  Reforestation sometimes is undertaken in an effort to reduce atmospheric carbon dioxide levels by restoring forests, which are carbon sinks.</skos:changeNote>
