System Note=update Definition
Old Value=Adapted from: Dictionary of Earth Science, 5th ed.. 1997.  Sybil Parker, ed. in chief.  McGraw-Hill.
New Value=https://www.epa.gov/acidrain/what-acid-rain</skos:changeNote>
