    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ABSOLUTE HUMIDITY</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2017-04-21 User Id=sritz Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: In a system of moist air, the ratio of the mass of water vapor present to the volume occupied by the mixture; that is, the density of the water vapor component.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2017-04-20 User Id=sritz Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=ABSOLUTE HUMIDITY [6b61a904-b92d-45ee-9061-aa5e61c29dd2,278847] - HUMIDITY [427e5121-a142-41cb-a8e9-a70b7f98eb6a,84651]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Glossary of Meteorology, American Meteorological Society" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In a system of moist air, the ratio of the mass of water vapor present to the volume occupied by the mixture; that is, the density of the water vapor component.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2017-04-21 13:22:58.0</dcterms:modified>
