    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Dissolved organic matter (DOM) produced by the decomposition of plantmaterial and the metabolism of plankton, originating in the ocean orbrought to the ocean by rivers, and producing a distinctive yellow-brownto yellow-red coloration of the water.</skos:definition>
