    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The Earth Radiation Budget is the balance between incoming energy from the sun and the outgoing longwave (thermal) and reflected shortwave energy from the Earth.[Source: Department of Marine and Coastal Sciences, Rutgers University, https://marine.rutgers.edu/cool/education/class/yuri/erb.html]</skos:definition>
