  <skos:Concept rdf:about="57a381ef-56f6-48af-8974-822f5859979d">
    <skos:broader rdf:resource="b887d3e5-4280-43d2-a34e-0f63ac086b6a"/>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">EQUATORIAL PACIFIC ZONAL WIND ANOMALY INDEX</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2012-07-09 User Id=mpmorahan Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The ENSO zonal wind anomaly index is calculated for the region 
8N-8S, 150E-140W from the COADS data. This region was chosen from a map of 
zonal wind regressed onto an index of eastern equatorial Pacific SST for the 
period 1950-79. The anomalies are with respect to a 1950-79 climatology.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="The University of Washington Joint Institute for the Study of the Atmosphere  and Ocean (JISAO): http://www.jisao.washington.edu/data/eqpaczonalwindts/" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The ENSO zonal wind anomaly index is calculated for the region 8N-8S, 150E-140W from the COADS data. This region was chosen from a map of zonal wind regressed onto an index of eastern equatorial Pacific SST for the period 1950-79. The anomalies are with respect to a 1950-79 climatology.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:modified>2012-07-09 11:26:06.0</dcterms:modified>
