New Value=SLEET [5beaf99c-0675-4af3-9236-f55d8d206d85,86333] - ICE PELLETS [cac27b59-7810-4132-87b4-53108663584e,106309]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Glossary of Weather and Climate, American Meteorological Society, 1996." xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">In the United States, frozen rain drops that bounce on impact with theground or other objects. Elsewhere, may refer to a mix of rain and snow, amix of rain and hail, or melting snow.</skos:definition>
