User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=AEROALLERGENS [6984e0a6-cb78-4f60-a31d-3ff8415e3829,368947] - ENVIRONMENTAL HEALTH FACTORS [5a47842e-785d-4cc4-b1c1-2147a9252c19,84159]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="Glossary of The Impacts of Climate Change on Human Health in the United States: A Scientific Assessment (https://health2016.globalchange.gov/glossary-and-acronyms#letter-a)" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Various airborne substances, such as pollen or spores, which cancause an allergic response.</skos:definition>
