    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-10-16 User Id=saritz Entity=Definition Operation=UPDATE Field=text 
User Note=updated definition
System Note=update Definition
Old Value=The temperature a dry air parcel would have if brought dry adiabatically
from its initial state to the standard pressure of 1000 hectopascals
(millibars).
New Value=The temperature that an unsaturated parcel of dry air would have if brought adiabatically and reversibly from its initial state to a standard pressure, p0, typically 100 kPa.</skos:changeNote>
