    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">DISSOLUTION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-11 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: The process by which a solid or liquid forms a solution in a solvent. In solids this can be explained as the breakdown of the crystal lattice into individual ions, atoms or molecules and their transport into the solvent.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
