    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">RIFFLE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-04-01 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A shallow stretch of a river or stream, where the current is above the average stream velocity and where the water forms small rippled waves as a result.
