User Note=Definition added
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: Phylum Chordata. Class Reptilia. Order Squamata. Lizards typically have feet and external ears. Snakes are elongated, legless, carnivorous reptiles with skin covered in scales.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="encyclopedia of life" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Phylum Chordata. Class Reptilia. Order Squamata. Lizards typically have feet and external ears. Snakes are elongated, legless, carnivorous reptiles with skin covered in scales.</skos:definition>
