User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
New Value=GLACIER EXTENT [79b569df-5ed1-4791-b089-c46484069d81,692291] - GLACIERS [68eed887-8008-4352-b420-949457ab59ab,689432]</skos:changeNote>
    <gcmd:reference gcmd:text="https://globalcryospherewatch.org/reference/glossary_docs/glossary_of_glacier_mass_balance_UNESCO.pdf" xml:lang="en"/>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Glacier extent is a glacier outline in horizontal space separating the glacier from unglacierized terrain or, at divides, from contiguous glaciers.</skos:definition>
