    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">SALTATION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-03-29 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=Definition Operation=INSERT 
System Note=insert Definition
New Value=id: null
text: A specific type of particle transport by fluids such as wind, or the denser fluid water. It occurs when loose material is removed from a bed and carried by the fluid, before being transported back to the surface.
language code: en</skos:changeNote>
    <skos:changeNote>Date=2013-02-18 User Id=tbs1979 Entity=BroaderRelation Operation=INSERT 
User Note=Insert Concept
System Note=add broader relation
